==English==

===Etymology===
{{etymon|en|:inh|enm:applicacioun<ety:bor<fro:aplicacion>>|:afeq|apply<id:lay>|-ication|tree=1}}
{{root|en|ine-pro|*pleḱ-}}
From Late {{inh|en|enm|applicacioun}}, borrowed from {{der|en|fro|aplicacion}} ({{cog|fr|application}}), from {{der|en|la|applicātiōnem}}, accusative singular of {{m|la|applicātiō||attachment; application, inclination}}, from {{m|la|applicō||join to, attach; apply}}. Equivalent to {{suf|en|apply|ication}}.

===Pronunciation===
